      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778153681470,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In a phyiscal delete situation do be detected on the input/source\ntable, we check what records are no longer part of a set for a given\ndp_loaded_at (green) compared to the previous set of data (red).\n\nIn the case shown to the left, the record with ID=3 is no longer part. \nWhen we delete it, we will use the dp_ts passed in the merge to terminate the record\n(setting the value to dp_ts_to in the SCD2 table).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In a phyiscal delete situation do be detected on the input/source\ntable, we check what records are no longer part of a set for a given\ndp_loaded_at (green) compared to the previous set of data (red).\n\nIn the case shown to the left, the record with ID=3 is no longer part. \nWhen we delete it, we will use the dp_ts passed in the merge to terminate the record\n(setting the value to dp_ts_to in the SCD2 table).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
